      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这是我自作主张的……\r\n而且要是再给训练员添麻烦什么的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4f0c9edd231a40b96bedb36f2b6e8e04e13d4cccefccfe6e62f85d5881989ae",
