      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因、因为……我，像今天这样因为冒失而迟到，\r\n或是中断训练的事，不是特别多吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "037eeaef718c0e0a47dc866a7075abc867310b3b5d873ed33e5359d0c6a0301a",
