    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d2d866efe81b2eba95915b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之前也是，想整理一下训练记录结果全都给删了，\r\n想稍微平整一下跑道结果卷进了压路机里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc42db67af38c0fe82936b89f1f17a2e8038cb852abcec99265b24ecd8469b84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
