    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb323b246c792b71f5b4471d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "步子没落好泼了一身沙子，取水洒了一身水，\r\n被毛巾缠住拉链爆开钮扣散落一地――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c288697701c40452844ef0402cf525b79ce7d0a320a012f6d7798e3d543dbd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
