    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9c7451de39002f09ba07dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在学园里找了几圈，几十分钟后――发现了一个在\r\n花坛前颤抖的茶色背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b4e46eaa10e1022ec38c1e207281587bde04c5795d7225e0f3b0096e3e3c87b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1058/storytimeline_041058005.json",
      "json_path": [
