      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deefb6ccf7d27b8e541370c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来，就给你添了很多很多的麻烦……\r\n训练员宝贵的时间，不能再留给我了～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb4ac74af6115e740343ac854e21c274daa4f6305339cde0edb99efc9dd91fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1058/storytimeline_041058005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2a392a56e94a7b43d6d917e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的冒失确实是异次元级别的。但即便如此，\r\n也没必要这样惶恐。更重要的是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "af608a1019a6dc2fb7de11c34425d78836eb28c8edd7a942ead6f4d1ae4b3839",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1058/storytimeline_041058005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17cec01440ac74237e0f3e8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个，怒涛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f5afc5777abff3b036725b137da9ceb8c824022cfade321056c7b5a77dbea5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1058/storytimeline_041058005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74a269f1b1b2f8519634c694",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个，怒涛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f5afc5777abff3b036725b137da9ceb8c824022cfade321056c7b5a77dbea5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1058/storytimeline_041058005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea1ffd0627a9bbfc284c0cab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想让她知道，作为她的签约训练员，她给我添多少麻烦\r\n都是可以的。可以说，只要是能帮助她成长的，我都乐意\r\n出手协助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "207681c6506c51c497e5be7be0b294b3237d934f99d3d27f4ea83d1d735f9957",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1058/storytimeline_041058005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fef828f55296ea03ed64ff1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e78ad4e295a8556cd58740ff999e622dd1a1a4ef5d397b15c3a365bf71d4514",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
