      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "窗、窗、窗户外面……！\r\n我的运动服飞起来了～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc911628fb73636707e469046bb8fd7f2e0508e96b7a716a17f729b37fbe5f8",
