    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98f9fbc1eab40b69d23ed5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊！　难道说是因为我为了让它快点干而增加了迎风面积，\r\n结果适得其反了……！？　得、得赶紧追上去～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5ad22340d7b87e654261f0a1cc3de7cab7aa1a17def5fabc171f3a87283522",
