    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0762e7593fcac8796905150",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊哇！？　对、对不起――呜呀ー！？\r\n对不起对不起……！　等、等等～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "166867f3df6750c9cc7490b28e65541aeeb4c504bfe41e55d933766f7065b47c",
